					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612#post-1555170</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612/we-re-off-to-be-the-lizard#post-1555170</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 03 Sep 2012 17:16:41 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>daioni</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1287530</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I suppose that's reasonable. I just see the aggressive ones (especially the really nasty ones, like 682) as being like the stuff of nightmares, call-of-cthulhu style. You glimpse one and it mentally destabilizes you for the rest of your life. You come directly up against one, and you're almost certainly screwed. Those kind of games are only really scary because the opposition so completely overpowers the guys fighting against it.</p> <p>It only makes sense that there'd be another element in there when different objects start&#8230; Well, clashing against each other. That Doctor Bright effectively <em>is</em> one himself strikes me as a bit of a departure from the theme, like some researcher in CoC getting no-downside immortality.</p> <p>Anyway, sorry for the negative opinion. Again, it's definitely well written.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612#post-1523510</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612/we-re-off-to-be-the-lizard#post-1523510</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 31 Jul 2012 06:24:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>AdminBright</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>224440</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Barbecue sauce was what Bright was using as a focus, to try and keep the adapting mind of 682 in check. By focusing on the one thing, he was able to override the mind of the beast, for a small time.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612#post-1523508</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612/we-re-off-to-be-the-lizard#post-1523508</link>
