					<![CDATA[
						 <p>See&#8230; Hmm. The point I was trying to make was he COULDN'T control it. Even though his shtick is 'Put 963 on, and your body is mine' even that couldn't defeat 682&#8230; and 682 LEARNED from Bright. Learnd enough to make him deadlier, possibly able to adapt at will.</p> 
				 	]]>
