					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612#post-738688</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-223612/we-re-off-to-be-the-lizard#post-738688</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 30 Mar 2010 20:46:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Sorts</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>323478</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Last time someone mentioned Dogpile Irregulars it was to castigate me for leaving such an unfunny joke up on my last comic.</p> <p>www.elfonlyinn.net</p> <p>P.S. The joke I had wanted to tell was about a blog I'd heard of called "Lurking Rhythmically" (never read it, don't plan on reading it) which would have triggered a response of "It sounds like you're teabagging the internet." I still think that would have been funnier, but I didn't want to dog on a blog I didn't read.</p> <p>P.P.S. Bizarrely the author of said blog somehow knew I was thinking of him and sent me a message about it which went unread for months and months.</p> <p>P.P.P.S. Oh now I remember why the dude knew I was thinking of him, I still threw in an edited version of the blog name. Man that last strip was ass.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
